  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "Both PopPert and SCALE address the challenge of predicting transcriptional responses from unpaired single-cell populations, leveraging population-level joint distribution modeling and conditional transport to enable perturbation-specific predictions across different types of perturbations. MRFlow and TempoBridge introduce new frameworks for predicting cellular responses to perturbations, focusing on optimizing both performance and interpretability in virtual cell modeling.",
